    "created_at": "2023-07-04T14:00:16Z",
    "updated_at": "2023-07-04T14:00:16Z",
    "body": "> \r\n\r\nSorry, I was wrong.\r\n\r\nLooks like 6.6 of [hide popovers until](https://html.spec.whatwg.org/#hide-all-popovers-until) could make sure element is the last element of auto popover list. So there is no need to repeat in [hidepopover](https://html.spec.whatwg.org/#hide-popover-algorithm).\r\n\r\nMaybe we could remove this? \"If the last item in document's [auto popover list](https://html.spec.whatwg.org/#auto-popover-list) is element, then [break](https://infra.spec.whatwg.org/#iteration-break).\"",
    "author_association": "NONE",
    "pin": null,
