    "updated_at": "2023-07-05T17:17:10Z",
    "body": "Oh weird, this definitely isn't right.\r\nBased on the [chromium implementation](https://source.chromium.org/chromium/chromium/src/+/main:third_party/blink/renderer/core/html/html_element.cc;l=1752-1764;drc=6bfe7cd47b0de410cc4c90ffbc873ccfc870077d), there is no such auto popover list check or break.\r\n\r\nIt looks like I changed this from an assert to a check in this PR: https://github.com/whatwg/html/pull/9198\r\nI need to do some more archeology to figure out if I messed this up or if that check was later removed in chromium.",
