    "updated_at": "2023-07-17T16:39:36Z",
    "body": "Ok, I think the reason that I mistakenly added that break is because I was trying to get [this chromium patch](https://chromium-review.googlesource.com/c/chromium/src/+/4459795) into the spec and I was going to make it a while(true) loop or something - the condition of the break matches the condition of the `while` in that chromium patch.\r\n\r\nI'll make a spec PR shortly to get this fixed",
